			"notes": "Chikorita Lover's Mod **version 0.3.0** focuses on adding new features related to the inventory, as well as other quality-of-life features.\n\n## Additons\n* Added new trades for mason villagers (253b1a6612d6e939b81459773647321ba0ee6cb8)\n  * Masons may now buy calcite, sell polished calcite, and sell lapis lazuli tiles\n* Added food tooltips to display food and food saturation restored (253b1a6612d6e939b81459773647321ba0ee6cb8)\n* Added horse armor tooltips to display armor provided (c859b06851f42b93022398350a066a8fecfc384d)\n* Added chainmail horse armor (96dbd35da5da859a8b5c46de27760e0971a158a0)\n  * Chainmail horse armor may be sold by armorer villagers, and can be found in village and dungeon chests\n* Moss can now be scraped from certain blocks (e.g. mossy cobblestone) with hoes (69d85635ed76aeec1e2fd6cfb3547afffdec8774)\n  * A new API has been added that can be used by other mods to utilize this behavior\n* Added stick bundles (32980e3d92993a65dc184266d90dcf819760c558)\n  * Stick bundles are storage blocks for sticks\n  * Stick bundles can be smelted into charcoal or used as furnace fuel\n\n## Changes\n* Potions now stack up to 16 (dffb02b9967d71f80c9cb03b7161c8598c14656a)\n  * Along with this change, a new API has been added that can be used by other mods to change the stack limits of items (186418215ecb5f39ecc2012333e8f92336d0731f)\n* Armor can now be quickly swapped by using it from the hotbar (ec3e6470386120d91a80503ea3a0a10ae7504e4d)\n* Cake slices, snowballs, and eggs now stack up to 64 (4d1a785a0e7288fa8c91f1cd23692b9101f8a4f4)\n* Cakes now stack up to 16 (4d1a785a0e7288fa8c91f1cd23692b9101f8a4f4)\n* Bundles can now be dyed, similarly to leather armor (fa27696391278f4dd00d1fed9d9064566ccde799)\n* Flower pots now produce sounds when a flower is planted (221af324106272f76c94c3386fe524dc4ad1f08a)\n* Cookies are now considered snacks and can be eaten quicker (91b211a0181ff5337583f1cb9831fbe223874b47)\n* Snowballs now produce sounds when they land (73dcc2ef41d1b56b1e2c51a9e9516ba2e219834c)\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Chikorita-Lover/Chikorita-Lover-Mod-Fabric/compare/v0.2.0...v0.3.0"
